{"speciesId":595,"names":{"fr":"Statitik","es":"Joltik","en":"Joltik","ja":"バチュル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les Statitik qui vivent en ville ont appris à aspirer le courant depuis les prises électriques des maisons."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Joltik that live in cities have learned a technique for sucking electricity from the outlets in houses."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il s’accroche aux Pokémon plus grands et aspire leur électricité statique. Il la stocke dans ses poches-accus."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They attach themselves to large-bodied Pokémon and absorb static electricity, which they store in an electric pouch."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Since it can’t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Since it can’t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ne produisant pas lui-même d’électricité, il s’accroche aux Pokémon plus grands et aspire leur électricité statique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No puede generar electricidad por sí mismo, así que se encarama a Pokémon grandes y absorbe su energía estática."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Since it can’t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"自分では 電気を つくれないので 他の 大きな ポケモンに とりつき 静電気を 吸いとる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il s’accroche aux Pokémon plus grands et aspire leur électricité statique. Il la stocke dans ses poches-accus."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se agarra a Pokémon de gran tamaño, absorbe su electricidad estática y la guarda en una bolsa interna."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They attach themselves to large-bodied Pokémon and absorb static electric